Subject: [PATCH 4/9] fix(server): typecheck hub hold HTTP, legacy session
 stop, settings op (#303)

- read the operator principal by yielding the service
- 0.0.x session stop interrupts active runs (thread.stop is server-only)
- add read-legacy-threads to ServerSettingsOperation
- Orchestrator layer type now requires SqlClient
- HTTP tests mock the new hold and dispatch services

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
